# Byte-exact archive. No end-of-line conversion, ever.
#
# This matters here specifically: a 2026-08-04 defect had Python's
# write_text turn existing CRLF into CR-CR-LF, which DOUBLED every
# reported line number and class length across the whole Java corpus.
# 100% of this corpus is CRLF. A repository that silently rewrites
# line endings on checkout could reintroduce that class of bug, and
# would make committed label batches no longer match their source.
* -text

# Binary , never diff or convert
*.parquet   binary
*.sqlite    binary
*.jar       binary
*.png       binary
*.webp      binary
*.gz        binary
